  "title": "[doc] Add aqt as alt download for Qt on Windows",
  "description": "Users who do not want to register for the official Qt Online Installer for Windows could use aqt -Another (unofficial) Qt CLI Installer- instead.\n\nTested and used since Qt 5.x with Wireshark 4.0 to today with Qt 6.5.3 without any issue (and much faster to setup than the official GUI client).",
